Empty on purpose, and tracked on purpose — see patterns/.gitkeep for why an
empty directory has to be tracked at all (main.css @source plus
tools/check-sources.mjs).

Reserved for page templates an editor can select. The 31 Pages currently render
through page.php and the parts in parts/pages/, chosen by slug, because the
route contract fixes which page renders what — a selectable template would be
one more way for an editor to change a URL's appearance without changing its
content.
